menu "Pet Access — Wi-Fi Station"

    config PET_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi SSID"
        default "YOUR_SSID_HERE"
        help
            SSID the WiFiStationService will associate with.
            Read by main.cpp at construction time and copied into
            WiFiStationService::Config — the component itself does not
            include sdkconfig.h, keeping it DI-pure (Document 06 §6).

    config PET_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi Password"
        default "YOUR_PASSWORD_HERE"
        help
            WPA2-PSK password for CONFIG_PET_WIFI_SSID.
            Leave blank for an open network.

endmenu
